["When you have eaten your fill, give thanks like this:", "\"We give you thanks, holy Father, for your holy name, which you have made to dwell in our hearts, and for the knowledge, faith and immortality you have revealed to us through Jesus your servant. Glory to you for ever.", "Almighty Master, you created all things for your name's sake. You gave people food and drink to enjoy, so that they would give you thanks; but to us you have freely given spiritual food and drink, and eternal life, through your servant.", "Above all, we thank you because you are mighty. Glory to you for ever.", "Remember your church, Lord: rescue her from all evil and make her perfect in your love. Gather her, made holy, from the four winds into your kingdom, which you have prepared for her. For yours are the power and the glory for ever.", "May grace come, and may this world pass away. Hosanna to the God of David. Whoever is holy, let him come; whoever is not, let him repent. Maranatha. Amen.\"", "But let the prophets give thanks as much as they wish."]